  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Published 2015; 140 x 225 mm; 150 pages; Cover: Paperback, color, glossy finish; Binding: glue bound; Interior: black and white; Edition limited to 250 copies" -- Publisher's description</subfield>
