  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"FROM MOMENT TO MOMENT IN NO TIME FROM TIME TO TIME IN NO TIME FROME IDEA TO IDEA IN NO TIME FROM PLACE TO PLACE IN NO TIME FROM THOUGHT TO THOUGHT IN NO TIME FROM KISS TO KISS IN NO TIME FROM COKE TO COKE IN NO TIME FROM LIFE TO DEATH IN NO TIME. The artists book articulated by the text piece 'TIME' is overlapped over and over and part of the information is lost. The work is an observation of a turbo capitalist society in which acceleration is a fact and a way of protest. The work questions time in not being linear but abstract. 'Timeless' is an adaptation from the artist's 2014 text piece 'Time'" -- Verlagswebsite</subfield>
